### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### List connections
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections

### Structured query
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/query/structured
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "table": "tasks",
  "columns": ["id", "title", "status"],
  "filters": [{"column": "status", "op": "=", "value": "TODO"}],
  "limit": 20
}

### NL query (requires LLM_API_KEY)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/query/nl
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "查出所有 TODO 任务"
}

### Mutate preview: insert
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/mutate/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "insert",
  "table": "tasks",
  "values": {
    "title": "新任务",
    "assignee_id": 1,
    "priority": "中",
    "status": "TODO"
  }
}

### Mutate preview: update (WHERE required)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/mutate/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "update",
  "table": "tasks",
  "set_values": {"status": "DONE"},
  "filters": [{"column": "id", "op": "=", "value": 1}]
}

### Confirm mutation (use preview_id from preview response)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/mutate/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "preview_id": "{{preview_id}}"
}

### Cancel pending preview
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/mutate/cancel/{{preview_id}}

### NL mutate preview (requires LLM_API_KEY; still needs confirm)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/mutate/nl
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "给负责人 1 新建一个优先级为高的任务：修复支付超时"
}
